# Build output and tooling caches, at the repository root.
#
# The Android project has its own .gitignore inside android/, which covers
# paths relative to that directory. Because the project now sits in a
# subdirectory, anything generated at the ROOT - which happens when Gradle is
# invoked from here - is not covered by it, and build caches and a
# machine-specific local.properties were committed by accident. This file closes
# that gap.

# Gradle's own state
.gradle/
build/

# Android build output, in case a module is ever built from the root
*/build/
**/build/
*.apk
*.aab

# ...except the published build, which is kept in the tree on purpose so the
# app is downloadable straight from the repository as well as from Releases.
!android/app-debug.apk

# Machine-specific: contains an absolute path to this machine's SDK
local.properties

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
